<h1 data-copy-en="Fernando" data-copy-zh="Fernando">Fernando</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Personal outfits, worker clothing, MAX fittings and the tailor’s exact costs." data-copy-zh="个人服装、员工服装、MAX定制与裁缝价格。">Personal outfits, worker clothing, MAX fittings and the tailor’s exact costs.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Fernando</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Prince_Barnard.27s_Three-Scene_Thread"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Prince_Barnard's_Three-Scene_Thread"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Community_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Fitting_Cost_Table"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Clothing_Income_Effects"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Supported_Workers_and_Fitting_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Reaching_Level_5"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="MAX_Worker_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Worker_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Clothing_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Player_Outfit_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Fernando — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/fernando.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Fernando — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/fernando.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Fernando — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Fernando’s Tailor Shop combines a personal relationship menu with location services for your outfits, worker clothing and maid equipment. Close his portrait to inspect the shop actions; not every purchase is on the portrait menu.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find Fernando</h2><p>Travel to Medieval → Kings Demesne → Merchants Quarter → Tailor Shop. Fernando and the shop services use 06:00–21:00 daily.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Tailor Shop</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Starting_His_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>No personal quest chain is required for the normal tailoring services. Talk takes 15 minutes, gives+2 base relationship and has 8 safe uses per day. Fashion Advice opens at Known(25) as a one-time 30-minute conversation.</p><p>The current Fashion Advice tooltip advertises Appearance+2, but it does not raise a standard player’s Attractiveness. Do not choose this conversation expecting that advertised stat increase; the relationship conversation and claim still proceed.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Performance_Reaction"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Actions_and_Fashion_Advice"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Personal outfit upgrades take 20 minutes each. Fernando handles Casual levels 3–5 and Dating/Formal levels 2–5; Casual level 2 is obtained earlier in the Present clothing shop. Upgrade one level at a time. The price table below lists the actual wealth and fabric costs.</p><p>Worker Clothing chooses an eligible active worker at random, not a selected portrait. A normal fitting raises clothing by 1 below level 5, with at most 2 normal Fernando fittings per worker. Each fitting takes 30 minutes, and Fernando permits only one fitting per game day across both ordinary and MAX services.</p><p>MAX Worker Clothing raises an eligible level 5 outfit to its final level 6. It can be used even if that worker already received two ordinary Fernando fittings. Its current price is twice the ordinary quote, with minimums of 100 Common,50 Rare and 25 Epic Fabrics and$5,000. Every successful fitting advances the shared price tier; after tier 50, the last price row is reused.</p><p>At clothing levels 2/3/4/5/MAX, the upper daily income bound is multiplied by 1.2/1.3/1.4/1.5/1.6. The lower bound is unchanged/+10%/+20%/+30%/+40%, and flat daily reputation is+1/+2/+3/+4/+5. These improve the worker’s pay range rather than guaranteeing the upper value.</p><p>Fashion is a separate skill lesson at Attractiveness 18:180 minutes,$300,50 Energy and 40 Calm. Presentable Uniform costs$1,200, is a maid item with+3%business reputation, requires owning the business and disappears while a copy is owned. Browse Clothes takes 5 minutes and restores 1 Calm.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Fernando</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tailor Shop; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">8 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fashion Advice</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tailor Shop; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">one-time conversation; see the Appearance note below; base relationship +8; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Tailor service</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost</th><th scope="col">Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Fashion</th><td data-label="Requirements">Attractiveness 18</td><td data-label="Base cost">180 min; $300; −50 Energy; −40 Calm</td><td data-label="Result">learn Fashion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Casual Lvl 3</th><td data-label="Requirements">Casual Outfit 2</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $1,000; Common Fabrics ×20</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Casual Lvl 4</th><td data-label="Requirements">Casual Outfit 3</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $5,000; Common Fabrics ×40; Rare Fabrics ×5</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Casual Lvl 5</th><td data-label="Requirements">Casual Outfit 4</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $20,000; Rare Fabrics ×10; Epic Fabrics ×5</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dating Lvl 2</th><td data-label="Requirements">Dating Outfit 1</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $250</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dating Lvl 3</th><td data-label="Requirements">Dating Outfit 2</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $1,000; Common Fabrics ×20</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dating Lvl 4</th><td data-label="Requirements">Dating Outfit 3</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $5,000; Common Fabrics ×40; Rare Fabrics ×5</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dating Lvl 5</th><td data-label="Requirements">Dating Outfit 4</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $20,000; Rare Fabrics ×10; Epic Fabrics ×5</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Formal Lvl 2</th><td data-label="Requirements">Formal Outfit 1</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $250</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Formal Lvl 3</th><td data-label="Requirements">Formal Outfit 2</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $1,000; Common Fabrics ×20</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Formal Lvl 4</th><td data-label="Requirements">Formal Outfit 3</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $5,000; Common Fabrics ×40; Rare Fabrics ×5</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Formal Lvl 5</th><td data-label="Requirements">Formal Outfit 4</td><td data-label="Base cost">20 min; $20,000; Rare Fabrics ×10; Epic Fabrics ×5</td><td data-label="Result">next outfit level</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Presentable Uniform</th><td data-label="Requirements">own the business</td><td data-label="Base cost">$1,200</td><td data-label="Result">maid item: reputation +3%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>All 50 current worker-fitting price tiers</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Purchase tier</th><th scope="col">Common Fabrics</th><th scope="col">Rare Fabrics</th><th scope="col">Epic Fabrics</th><th scope="col">Wealth</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">1</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">10</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">5</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">1</td><td data-label="Wealth">300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">15</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">7</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">2</td><td data-label="Wealth">350</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">25</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">10</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">3</td><td data-label="Wealth">400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">32</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">13</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">4</td><td data-label="Wealth">500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">40</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">16</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">5</td><td data-label="Wealth">550</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">46</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">20</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">6</td><td data-label="Wealth">600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">52</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">24</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">7</td><td data-label="Wealth">700</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">58</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">27</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">8</td><td data-label="Wealth">900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">64</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">31</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">9</td><td data-label="Wealth">1,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">70</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">35</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">10</td><td data-label="Wealth">1,200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">11</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">76</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">39</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">12</td><td data-label="Wealth">1,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">12</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">82</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">43</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">14</td><td data-label="Wealth">1,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">13</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">88</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">47</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">16</td><td data-label="Wealth">1,800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">14</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">94</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">51</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">18</td><td data-label="Wealth">2,100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">15</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">100</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">55</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">20</td><td data-label="Wealth">2,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">16</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">106</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">59</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">23</td><td data-label="Wealth">2,900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">17</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">112</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">63</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">26</td><td data-label="Wealth">3,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">18</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">118</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">67</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">29</td><td data-label="Wealth">3,900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">19</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">124</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">71</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">32</td><td data-label="Wealth">4,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">20</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">130</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">75</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">35</td><td data-label="Wealth">5,300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">21</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">136</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">79</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">38</td><td data-label="Wealth">6,200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">22</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">142</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">83</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">41</td><td data-label="Wealth">7,200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">23</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">148</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">87</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">44</td><td data-label="Wealth">8,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">24</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">154</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">91</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">47</td><td data-label="Wealth">9,800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">25</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">160</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">95</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">50</td><td data-label="Wealth">11,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">26</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">165</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">98</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">53</td><td data-label="Wealth">13,200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">27</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">170</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">101</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">56</td><td data-label="Wealth">15,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">28</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">175</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">104</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">59</td><td data-label="Wealth">17,900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">29</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">180</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">107</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">62</td><td data-label="Wealth">20,800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">30</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">185</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">110</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">65</td><td data-label="Wealth">24,200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">31</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">189</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">113</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">68</td><td data-label="Wealth">28,200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">32</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">193</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">116</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">71</td><td data-label="Wealth">32,800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">33</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">197</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">119</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">74</td><td data-label="Wealth">38,100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">34</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">201</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">122</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">77</td><td data-label="Wealth">44,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">35</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">205</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">125</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">80</td><td data-label="Wealth">51,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">36</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">209</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">127</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">82</td><td data-label="Wealth">60,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">37</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">213</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">129</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">84</td><td data-label="Wealth">69,900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">38</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">217</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">131</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">86</td><td data-label="Wealth">81,300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">39</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">221</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">133</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">88</td><td data-label="Wealth">94,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">40</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">225</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">135</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">90</td><td data-label="Wealth">110,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">41</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">228</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">137</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">91</td><td data-label="Wealth">128,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">42</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">231</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">139</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">92</td><td data-label="Wealth">148,900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">43</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">234</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">141</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">93</td><td data-label="Wealth">173,300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">44</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">237</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">143</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">94</td><td data-label="Wealth">201,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">45</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">240</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">145</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">95</td><td data-label="Wealth">234,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">46</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">242</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">146</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">96</td><td data-label="Wealth">272,900</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">47</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">244</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">147</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">97</td><td data-label="Wealth">317,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">48</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">246</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">148</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">98</td><td data-label="Wealth">369,400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">49</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">248</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">149</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">99</td><td data-label="Wealth">429,800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">50</th><td data-label="Common Fabrics">250</td><td data-label="Rare Fabrics">150</td><td data-label="Epic Fabrics">99</td><td data-label="Wealth">500,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>No eligible normal fitting can mean every active eligible worker is already at 5 or has used two Fernando fittings. Claw-machine clothing can help reach 5; use the separate MAX action for the final level.</p><p>A fitting used earlier today blocks both fitting choices. The price is based on all prior Fernando purchases, not the chosen worker alone. Personal outfit purchases are a different service and do not use this daily fitting allowance.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-brothel-stats-and-calculations.html">Worker income calculations</a> · <a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">Claw-machine clothing</a> · <a href="walkthrough-wealth-guide.html">Outfits and Working Experience</a> · <a href="game-systems-maid-system.html">Maid equipment</a> · <a href="items.html">Items</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Prince_Barnard.27s_Three-Scene_Thread"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Prince_Barnard's_Three-Scene_Thread"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Community_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Fitting_Cost_Table"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Clothing_Income_Effects"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Supported_Workers_and_Fitting_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Reaching_Level_5"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-MAX_Worker_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Worker_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Clothing_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Player_Outfit_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Fernando 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/fernando.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Fernando 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/fernando.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Fernando 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Fernando的裁缝店同时提供个人关系菜单，以及个人服装、员工服装和女仆装备的地点服务。购买时也要关闭头像查看地点动作，并非所有商品都在人物菜单里。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>路线为中世纪 → 国王领地 → 商人区 → 裁缝店，Fernando和商店服务每天06:00—21:00可用。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">裁缝店</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Starting_His_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>普通裁缝服务不要求先完成个人任务链。交谈耗15分钟、基础关系+2，每天安全额度8次。已知（25）时可进行一次30分钟的时尚建议。</p><p>当前时尚建议提示写有外貌+2，但它不会提高标准玩家角色的吸引力。不要为该项提示中的属性提升而选择它；对话及一次性领取记录仍会正常推进。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Performance_Reaction"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Actions_and_Fashion_Advice"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>个人服装每次升级耗20分钟。Fernando负责休闲装3—5级，以及约会装、正装2—5级；休闲装2级先在现代服装店取得。必须逐级购买，下表列出实际财富与布料价格。</p><p>员工服装会从符合条件的在职员工中随机选人，不是由玩家点选某个人。普通定制在服装未满5级时加1级，每人最多获得2次Fernando普通定制。每次耗30分钟，而且普通与MAX服务共用每天一次的定制额度。</p><p>「员工服装升至MAX」将符合条件的5级服装升至最终6级，即使该员工已用过两次普通定制，也可以使用。价格为当前普通报价的两倍，但至少消耗普通布料100、稀有布料50、史诗布料25及财富5,000。每次成功定制都会推进共用价格档位，第50档后继续沿用最后一档。</p><p>服装2／3／4／5／MAX级分别使每日收入上限乘1.2／1.3／1.4／1.5／1.6，下限分别不变／+10%／+20%／+30%／+40%，每日固定声誉分别+1／+2／+3／+4／+5。这是改善工资区间，不保证每次都领到上限。</p><p>时尚是另外的技能课程，要求吸引力18，耗180分钟、财富300、精力50与镇定40。体面制服售1,200财富，是声誉+3%的女仆装备，要求已拥有青楼，持有同款时会隐藏。浏览衣服则耗5分钟，恢复镇定1。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和Fernando交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">裁缝店; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">8次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">时尚建议</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">裁缝店; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性对话；外貌奖励见下方说明；基础关系+8；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">裁缝服务</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗</th><th scope="col">结果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">时尚</th><td data-label="条件">吸引力18</td><td data-label="基础消耗">180分钟；财富300；−50 精力；−40 镇定</td><td data-label="结果">学会时尚</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">休闲装等级3</th><td data-label="条件">休闲装等级2</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富1,000；普通布料×20</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">休闲装等级4</th><td data-label="条件">休闲装等级3</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富5,000；普通布料×40；稀有布料×5</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">休闲装等级5</th><td data-label="条件">休闲装等级4</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富20,000；稀有布料×10；史诗布料×5</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">约会装等级2</th><td data-label="条件">约会装等级1</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富250</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">约会装等级3</th><td data-label="条件">约会装等级2</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富1,000；普通布料×20</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">约会装等级4</th><td data-label="条件">约会装等级3</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富5,000；普通布料×40；稀有布料×5</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">约会装等级5</th><td data-label="条件">约会装等级4</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富20,000；稀有布料×10；史诗布料×5</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">正装等级2</th><td data-label="条件">正装等级1</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富250</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">正装等级3</th><td data-label="条件">正装等级2</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富1,000；普通布料×20</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">正装等级4</th><td data-label="条件">正装等级3</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富5,000；普通布料×40；稀有布料×5</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">正装等级5</th><td data-label="条件">正装等级4</td><td data-label="基础消耗">20分钟；财富20,000；稀有布料×10；史诗布料×5</td><td data-label="结果">升至所示服装等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">体面制服</th><td data-label="条件">已拥有青楼</td><td data-label="基础消耗">财富1,200</td><td data-label="结果">女仆装备：声誉+3%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>展开员工服装的50档当前价格</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">累计购买档位</th><th scope="col">普通布料</th><th scope="col">稀有布料</th><th scope="col">史诗布料</th><th scope="col">财富</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">1</th><td data-label="普通布料">10</td><td data-label="稀有布料">5</td><td data-label="史诗布料">1</td><td data-label="财富">300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="普通布料">15</td><td data-label="稀有布料">7</td><td data-label="史诗布料">2</td><td data-label="财富">350</td></tr>